abstract: >
  Cairn is a self-contained, stack-aware system-design engine for AI coding assistants. It guides
  complete beginners to correct, scalable architecture and gives experts an enforceable, citable
  standard, with a full design → plan → build → verify lifecycle and built-in guardrails against
  over-engineering.
